        </details>
        <details class="group border border-slate-200 rounded-xl p-4">
          <summary class="font-semibold text-slate-900 cursor-pointer">Will High Economic Impact thresholds be lower in 2027?</summary>
          <p class="mt-3 text-slate-700">Nobody knows yet. Thresholds fell through 2026, from $70 per hour and 138 points in February to $52 per hour and 131 points in September, as BC received more nominations. The 2027 allocation has not been announced, and WelcomeBC warns that future High Economic Impact invitations may be based on different factors.</p>
